ted zero goes out as 0x0000, except in UDP, where zero means no checksum - all ones goes instead, and a zero passes over IPv4 only. ChecksumTest compares every length up to 2100 bytes with a word-by-word sum","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"united-manufacturing-hub/united-manufacturing-hub","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-22T00:11:36Z","branch":"staging","commit_sha":"e01ee4c2602370894148cf8ce902a63c51ff2418","github_link":"https://github.com/united-manufacturing-hub/united-manufacturing-hub/commit/e01ee4c2602370894148cf8ce902a63c51ff2418","commit_subject":"refactor(fsmv2): add a generic channel provider interface in deps","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"astropy/astroplan","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-22T00:11:08Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"e6a203b0a5e482ca50f2353fef162859f1446c8d","github_link":"https://github.com/astropy/astroplan/commit/e6a203b0a5e482ca50f2353fef162859f1446c8d","commit_subject":"Let old astropy fall through to the IERS mirror in tests","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"bex-co/beancount-io","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-22T00:10:14Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"82be7528e9010ce531a416871d451cf770f01700","github_link":"https://github.com/bex-co/beancount-io/commit/82be7528e9010ce531a416871d451cf770f01700","commit_subject":"chore(pm): recheck note for w21/214 (no mismatch server reachable)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"ASC-Community/AngouriMath","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-22T00:10:01Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"099dfc7cb25f048913b68a16dd55a8ec2d4c58f0","github_link":"https://github.com/ASC-Community/AngouriMath/commit/099dfc7cb25f048913b68a16dd55a8ec2d4c58f0","commit_subject":"Integrate a transcendental function of one shifted linear in it, the logarithms of a quotient onto the exponential integral, and derivatives over a power of a logarithm or an inverse (#2034)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"abrignoni/iLEAPP","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-22T00:09:51Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"b426af7053a50aca57d643a028b76bec780e6980","github